# The syntax corpus is byte-exact test data. Most fixtures are LF, but cr.ftl
# and crlf.ftl deliberately carry lone-CR and CRLF line endings to exercise the
# parser's line-end handling. Freeze every fixture as-committed (-text = no eol
# conversion) so a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true can't rewrite LF to
# CRLF and break the exact-match tests.
test/_corpus/syntax/*.ftl  -text
test/_corpus/syntax/*.json -text
